      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} TMP_CharacterInfo is not exposed in SDK 3.7.0 either.\n\nThe test code is as follows:\n\n```\n\nusing TMPro;\n\nusing UdonSharp;\n\nusing UnityEngine;\n\npublic class TMP_CharacterInfoTest : UdonSharpBehaviour\n\n{\n\n\t[SerializeField] private TextMeshProUGUI _text;\n\n\tprivate void Start()\n\n\t{\n\n\t\tDebug.Log(_text.textInfo.characterInfo[0].index);\n\n\t}\n\n}\n\n```\n\nThe related Canny is as follows:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1137added-characterinfotextmeshpro-to-whitelist",
