      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently, the ActivateInputField() method of TMP_InputField is not exposed to Udon, and attempting to use it results in the following error:\n\nMethod is not exposed to Udon: '_inputField.ActivateInputField()'\n\nBecause of this, it is not possible to activate the input field from a script, which can be inconvenient in certain situations.\n\nIt would be very helpful if ActivateInputField() could also be made available from Udon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
